WEBVTT

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:29.840
I've been too long on the run, gonna have my plane, gonna have my fun, here's a cowboy.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.480
sing when the roundup's done, gonna ride pinto once more by the Alamo, see my gal and my

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:49.800
pal and the old corral once more, so I'm hittin' the trail to the settlin' sun, Texas home

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.400
never more too long, here I come.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:51.780
I can't. Been too long on the run. Gonna have my fling. Gonna have my fun. Hear the cowboys sing when the roundup's done.

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:04.070
I'm hittin' the train.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:06.640
To the saddening side
